                                </node>
                                <node id="SubClass"> Subclass. add this part at a level when your class chooses its subclass
                                    <attribute id="Object" type="guid" value="46edbb6d-ad17-4e11-a686-324194b03796"/> same UUID as the one for your subclass in ClassDescriptions.lsx
